# Flow

```mermaid after
sequenceDiagram
  Note over a: the caption
  Note over a: a second caption
  a->>b: calls B
  %% stop: a.go:3-3
  Note over a,b: its caption
  Note over a,b: a second caption
  loop every line
    Note over b: before any message
    b->>b: prints
    opt sometimes
      b->>a: answers
    end
    Note over a: after the block it follows
  end
  else not in an alt
  end
  opt nothing inside
  end
  alt never closed
    a->>b: again
```

